From 93fdcd75c61cfe8d96cf3851d7be1610da55d14a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: unitylht <142583978+unitylht@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:45:21 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(client): Nucleon link in the left nav

Adds a Nucleon icon button to the left rail (also when the sidebar is collapsed)
that opens the Nucleon address in a new tab (target=_blank, rel=noopener). The
address is the build-time Vite env VITE_NUCLEON_URL (default
https://nucleon.dracooz.top); the Dockerfile passes it as a build arg. Changing
it needs a rebuild. Client only; no server or startup-config change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
